{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着英偉達近年來在人工智能領域持續崛起，並成長為全球最具影響力的科技企業之一，關於公司未來領導層接班規劃的話題正在受到業界廣泛關注。最新報道稱，蘋果負責晶片研發業務的高級副總裁約翰尼·斯魯吉（Johny Srouji）已成為外界討論的潛在英偉達行政總裁人選之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586082.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T13:24:02.728162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:15:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:23.133658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:23.133658+00:00","content_hash":"af2fae05e0fdd1a033db2299ca23279ed58a25c90e1767f409a95672c9d8571f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}